 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "In the hill country of Seir the line began",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.82,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Esau the father of the Edomites is named",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.29,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Eliphaz his firstborn son from Adah came",
   "heard": 3,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.83,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And the chiefs among his descendants rose to fame",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.75,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Chief Teman and Chief Omar stand tall",
   "heard": 3,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.76,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Chief Zepho and Chief Kenaz answer the call",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.84,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Descended from Eliphaz in the land of Edom",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.89,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Their history is written in the family song",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.67,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The sons of Eliphaz are listed by name",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.23,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Teman Omar Zepho Gatam and Kenaz are the same",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.36,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They formed the foundation of the tribes so dear",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.33,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Settled in the mountains for generations near",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.65,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Chief Teman and Chief Omar stand tall",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.84,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Chief Zepho and Chief Kenaz answer the call",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.73,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Descended from Eliphaz in the land of Edom",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.92,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Their history is written in the family song",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.62,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "From Adam to the end the genealogy flows",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.42,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "One Chronicles confirms what the record knows",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.69,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Omar is a chief in the line of Esau",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.71,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "His place in the history is firmly drawn",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.22,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Chief Omar is named in the book of Genesis",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.57,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
